* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.pdf binary
*.blend binary
*.glb binary
*.zip binary
*.zst binary

# Cited evidence is stored byte-exact. The claims pack binds each artifact by the
# sha256 of its bytes, and several receipts were written as CRLF; normalising
# them to LF made every clone disagree with the published digest. Never let git,
# an editor or a formatter rewrite these files.
docs/evidence/artifacts/** -text
